[background arg="res://assets/misc/black.png" fade="0.0"]
join anemon left
join latern right
anemon: We have some more questions for you Ms.Light.
latern: Sure.
label chained
anemon: How many accounting books do you have ?
latern: Just the one, both precious and terrible. A relief for the lucky but a sentence for the unprepared
[wait time="1.0"]
latern: This place doesn't actually have much expenses. We've been running it on an ever tighter budget. The cogs of money crush fish under bureaucracy's weight !
anemon: I see, only the One Book for the accounting with Aggigawhale then.
latern: Indeed
anemon: Yet you were seen pushing a cart full of books during the evening.
latern: Oh... Did I forget to mention that ? I can get disoriented sometimes. I picked up some books lying here and there on my way back to the library. I was with the cart when I got back to the library.
set {NextDialogue.lantern} = "lantern_busy"